WEBVTT

00:09.143 --> 00:10.378
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.411 --> 00:12.413
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.446 --> 00:13.781
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.814 --> 00:15.483
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.516 --> 00:18.686
* OH...
* 哦...

00:18.719 --> 00:20.788
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.821 --> 00:22.790
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.823 --> 00:25.293
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.326 --> 00:26.694
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.727 --> 00:29.097
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:29.130 --> 00:30.364
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:30.398 --> 00:33.134
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.167 --> 00:34.768
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:34.802 --> 00:36.704
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.737 --> 00:39.707
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:39.740 --> 00:40.741
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.774 --> 00:43.377
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:43.411 --> 00:45.246
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.279 --> 00:49.217
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.250 --> 00:50.718
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:03.531 --> 01:06.434
( with French accent ):
HALLOWEEN IS NO DIFFERENT
UNDER THE WAVES--
（带有法国口音）：
万圣节也不例外
海浪之下——

01:06.467 --> 01:09.837
PIRATES, SKELETONS
AND SEA MONSTERS...
海盗、骷髅
还有海怪...

01:09.870 --> 01:11.139
( laughing evilly )
（邪恶地笑）

01:11.172 --> 01:12.506
OOP, SORRY.
哎呀，抱歉。

01:12.540 --> 01:14.308
EVERYONE HAVING FUN.
每个人都玩得很开心。

01:14.342 --> 01:16.677
WELL, ALMOST EVERYONE.
嗯，几乎每个人。

01:18.279 --> 01:19.247
HUH?
( thump )
嗯？
（扑通）

01:19.280 --> 01:20.314
( hinge creaks eerily )
（铰链发出奇怪的吱吱声）

01:20.348 --> 01:21.349
WHO'S THERE?
谁在那儿？

01:26.554 --> 01:29.823
( deep, cacklelike creaking )
（深沉的、嘎嘎般的吱吱声）

01:32.460 --> 01:33.527
( whimpering nervously )
（紧张地呜咽）

01:33.561 --> 01:36.464
OKAY, MR. KRABS, THE DISHES
ARE DONE-- I'M LEAVING.
好的，先生。螃蟹，菜肴
完成了——我要走了。

01:37.265 --> 01:38.632
HOLD ON.
坚持，稍等。

01:38.666 --> 01:42.436
DON'T YOU WANT TO HEAR
MY ANNUAL SCARY STORY?
你不想听吗
我的年度恐怖故事？

01:42.470 --> 01:43.604
NO, THANK YOU, MR. KRABS.
不，谢谢您，先生。螃蟹。

01:43.637 --> 01:45.906
UH, DOES IT HAVE MONSTERS IN IT?
呃，里面有怪物吗？

01:45.939 --> 01:49.310
AYE-- THE WORST MONSTER
OF THEM ALL.
AYE——最糟糕的怪物
他们全部。

01:49.343 --> 01:50.711
UH...
呃……

01:50.744 --> 01:51.745
NO.
不。

01:52.580 --> 01:54.382
IS IT A TRUE STORY?
这是一个真实的故事吗？

01:54.415 --> 01:56.717
TRUE AS THE DEEP BLUE.
真实如深蓝色。

01:56.750 --> 01:58.452
OKAY, MAYBE JUST A LITTLE.
好吧，也许只是一点点。

01:58.486 --> 01:59.720
HAVE A SEAT, ME BOY.
请坐，我的孩子。

02:01.455 --> 02:03.691
HOT, HOT, HOT,
HOT, HOT, HOT, HOT!
热，热，热，
热，热，热，热！

02:03.724 --> 02:06.727
EVERY YEAR,
ON HALLOWEEN NIGHT
每年，
万圣节之夜

02:06.760 --> 02:11.299
THE FLYING DUTCHMAN
DESCENDS ON BIKINI BOTTOM
飞翔的荷兰人
比基尼下摆

02:11.332 --> 02:12.766
IN A PIRATE SHIP...
在海盗船上...

02:12.800 --> 02:14.535
JUST LIKE THIS
就像这样

02:14.568 --> 02:16.170
ONLY BIGGER.
只是更大。

02:16.204 --> 02:18.706
EXCUSE ME, DID HIS SHIP
LOOK LIKE A KRABBY PATTY?
对不起，他的船了吗？
看起来像蟹肉饼吗？

02:18.739 --> 02:22.910
LIKE I WAS SAYING,
THE FLYING DUTCHMAN SWOOPS DOWN
就像我说的，
飞翔的荷兰人俯冲而下

02:22.943 --> 02:26.714
AND STARTS
STEALING PEOPLE'S SOULS.
并开始
窃取人们的灵魂。

02:26.747 --> 02:28.516
DO SOULS LOOK LIKE PICKLES?
灵魂看起来像泡菜吗？

02:28.549 --> 02:30.618
AYE, AS A MATTER OF FACT,
THEY DO.
是的，事实上，
他们确实如此。

02:30.651 --> 02:33.454
THEN HE PUTS THEM
WHERE YOU CAN NEVER GET THEM--
然后他把它们
在你永远无法得到它们的地方——

02:33.487 --> 02:35.589
IN HIS SOUL BAG.
在他的灵魂袋里。

02:35.623 --> 02:36.890
( laughing evilly )
（邪恶地笑）

02:38.226 --> 02:40.428
I'VE COME
FOR YOUR PICKLE.
我来了
为了你的泡菜。

02:40.461 --> 02:42.463
( screams )
（尖叫声）

02:42.496 --> 02:45.899
HA! SCAREDY-PANTS GETS
EASIER TO SCARE EVERY YEAR!
哈！恐怖裤得到
每年都更容易被吓到！

02:45.933 --> 02:47.735
( both laugh heartily )
（两人都开怀大笑）

02:47.768 --> 02:49.503
HMM... SQUIDWARD.
嗯……章鱼哥。

02:49.537 --> 02:52.540
NOTHING LIKE A GOOD
GHOST STORY, EH, ME BOY?
没有什么比好的
鬼故事，呃，我的孩子？

02:52.573 --> 02:56.344
HOPE YOU'RE NOT TOO SCARED
TO COME TO ME PARTY TONIGHT
希望你不要太害怕
今晚来参加我的派对

02:56.377 --> 02:58.712
SPONGEBOB SCAREDY-PANTS.
海绵宝宝恐怖裤。

02:58.746 --> 03:01.815
( laughing )
（笑）

03:03.384 --> 03:05.386
STEAL YOUR SOUL.
偷走你的灵魂。

03:05.419 --> 03:06.487
( screams )
（尖叫声）

03:08.556 --> 03:09.457
( evil laughter )
（邪恶的笑声）

03:09.490 --> 03:10.624
( gasps )
（喘气）

03:13.427 --> 03:14.628
TRICK OR TREAT.
不给糖就捣蛋。

03:14.662 --> 03:15.596
( SpongeBob yells )
（海绵宝宝大喊）

03:15.629 --> 03:17.498
IT'S OKAY, SON.
没关系，儿子。

03:17.531 --> 03:19.767
THAT'S JUST
SPONGEBOB SCAREDY-PANTS.
就是这样
海绵宝宝恐怖裤。

03:19.800 --> 03:21.469
( honks )
( screams )
（按喇叭）
（尖叫声）

03:21.502 --> 03:22.670
( teeth chattering )
（牙齿打颤）

03:22.703 --> 03:24.772
HAPPY HALLOWEEN, SCAREDY-PANTS.
万圣节快乐，恐怖裤。

03:24.805 --> 03:26.474
( cackles )
（咯咯笑）

03:26.507 --> 03:28.509
THE NAME'S SQUAREPANTS.
名字叫方裤。

03:28.542 --> 03:31.712
IT'S SQUAREPANTS!
这是方裤！

03:31.745 --> 03:33.714
SpongeBob:
I DON'T GET IT, GARY.
海绵宝宝：
我不明白，加里。

03:33.747 --> 03:38.018
EVERY HALLOWEEN, NO MATTER HOW
HARD I TRY, EVERYBODY SCARES ME.
每个万圣节，无论怎样
我努力尝试，每个人都吓到我。

03:38.051 --> 03:39.653
( Gary meows )
（加里喵）

03:39.687 --> 03:41.221
WELL, I'M SICK OF IT.
好吧，我厌倦了。

03:45.526 --> 03:47.461
NO MORE SCAREDY-PANTS.
不再有恐怖裤了。

03:47.495 --> 03:48.462
( screams )
（尖叫声）

03:48.496 --> 03:49.497
( knees clattering )
（膝盖嘎吱作响）

03:49.530 --> 03:50.364
( knocking at door )
（敲门）

03:50.398 --> 03:51.899
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

03:51.932 --> 03:53.467
GARY, IT'S PATRICK.
加里，我是帕特里克。

03:53.501 --> 03:54.902
I'M GOING TO SCARE HIM.
我要吓唬他。

03:54.935 --> 03:56.404
IT'S MY TURN.
轮到我了。

03:56.437 --> 03:58.372
RAR!
RAR！
RAR！
解压！

03:58.406 --> 03:59.373
HIYA, SPONGEBOB.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

03:59.407 --> 04:00.608
( scream, crunch )
（尖叫声、嘎吱声）

04:00.641 --> 04:02.810
SORRY, I DIDN'T
MEAN TO SCARE YOU.
抱歉，我没有
意思是吓唬你。

04:02.843 --> 04:05.413
WHY CAN'T I BE
FRIGHTENING FOR ONCE?
为什么我不能
一次令人恐惧吗？

04:05.446 --> 04:08.316
WHERE'S MY CHANCE?
我的机会在哪里？

04:08.349 --> 04:09.917
IF YOU WANT
TO BE SCARY
如果你愿意
变得可怕

04:09.950 --> 04:12.820
YOU'RE GOING TO NEED
A GOOD COSTUME.
你需要
一套好服装。

04:13.754 --> 04:15.689
WHAT DO YOU THINK?
你怎么认为？

04:15.723 --> 04:18.692
GREAT! YOU'RE GOING
AS MY TRICK-OR-TREAT BAG.
伟大的！你要去
作为我的“不给糖就捣蛋”包。

04:18.726 --> 04:20.561
NO, NO!
不，不！

04:20.594 --> 04:22.963
I'M THE GHOST
OF THE FLYING DUTCHMAN.
我是幽灵
飞翔的荷兰人号。

04:22.996 --> 04:25.899
UH, SOMETHING'S MISSING.
呃，有东西不见了。

04:25.933 --> 04:26.967
I KNOW!
我知道！

04:27.968 --> 04:29.737
( hand-sawing )
（手锯）

04:29.770 --> 04:30.871
( power-sawing )
（电锯）

04:33.807 --> 04:35.876
STEP INTO THESE BABIES, HANS.
汉斯，走进这些婴儿。

04:37.578 --> 04:39.547
TERRIFYING.
太可怕了。

04:39.580 --> 04:41.715
I DON'T KNOW, PATRICK.
我不知道，帕特里克。

04:41.749 --> 04:42.683
( kids giggle )
（孩子们咯咯笑）

04:42.716 --> 04:43.817
( doorbell rings )
（门铃响了）

04:43.851 --> 04:45.519
COME ON, IT'S LITTLE KIDS!
来吧，都是小孩子！

04:45.553 --> 04:46.954
LITTLE KIDS ARE EASY TO SCARE.
小孩子很容易被吓到。

04:47.888 --> 04:50.458
TRICK OR TREAT!
不给糖就捣蛋！

04:50.491 --> 04:52.092
RAR, RAR!
RAR，RAR！
RAR，RAR！
解压，解压！

04:52.125 --> 04:55.429
( laughing )
（笑）

04:55.463 --> 04:57.965
LOOK, IT'S
THE HAUNTED
MATTRESS.
看，这是
闹鬼的
床垫。

04:57.998 --> 05:00.501
OKAY, OKAY--
HERE'S YOUR CANDY.
好吧，好吧——
这是你的糖果。

05:00.534 --> 05:01.735
NO... PLEASE.
不……拜托。

05:01.769 --> 05:03.471
THAT WAS ENOUGH
OF A TREAT.
够了
款待。

05:03.504 --> 05:04.538
THANK YOU.
谢谢。

05:04.572 --> 05:05.406
( kids laughing )
（孩子们笑）

05:07.541 --> 05:09.343
I DON'T GET IT, PATRICK.
我不明白，帕特里克。

05:09.377 --> 05:10.678
SPONGEBOB
海绵宝宝

05:10.711 --> 05:12.413
LOOK AT MY NEW PAPER GHOST.
看看我的新纸幽灵。

05:12.446 --> 05:14.348
OOH!
哦！

05:14.382 --> 05:15.683
SCARY...
可怕的...

05:15.716 --> 05:17.551
THAT IS IT, PATRICK.
就是这样，帕特里克。

05:17.585 --> 05:18.552
WHAT'S IT?
这是什么？

05:18.586 --> 05:19.687
WHAT'S THE DIFFERENCE
有什么不同

05:19.720 --> 05:21.088
BETWEEN THAT GHOST
AND ME?
在那幽灵之间
还有我呢？

05:21.121 --> 05:22.356
UH...
呃……

05:24.392 --> 05:26.560
NO, NO, NO,
WAIT, DON'T TELL ME.
不，不，不，
等等，别告诉我。

05:26.594 --> 05:29.062
( Patrick groaning
with exertion )
（帕特里克呻吟
用力）

05:29.096 --> 05:31.131
D-D-DON'T TELL ME.
I CAN DO THIS!
别、别、别告诉我。
我能做到！

05:31.164 --> 05:33.967
I CAN DO THIS,
DON'T TELL ME,
DON'T TELL ME!
我可以做到这一点，
别告诉我，
别告诉我！

05:34.001 --> 05:35.469
DON'T TELL ME!
别告诉我！

05:35.503 --> 05:36.704
OKAY, TELL ME.
好吧，告诉我。

05:36.737 --> 05:39.373
I'VE GOT A SQUARE HEAD
我有一个方头

05:39.407 --> 05:41.642
AND A REAL GHOST
HAS A ROUND ONE.
和一个真正的幽灵
有第一轮。

05:41.675 --> 05:43.811
ALL WE HAVE TO DO
IS MAKE MY HEAD ROUND
我们要做的就是
让我转过头来

05:43.844 --> 05:45.913
AND-- BOO!-- I'M SCARY.
而且——嘘！——我很害怕。

05:47.080 --> 05:48.782
OKAY, ARE YOU READY?
好吧，你准备好了吗？

05:48.816 --> 05:51.018
REMEMBER, LIKE THIS.
记住，像这样。

05:55.523 --> 05:57.825
YOU SURE YOU WANT
TO DO THIS?
你确定你想要
要这样做吗？

05:57.858 --> 06:00.494
SHAVE ME DOWN, MAKE ME ROUND.
把我剃光，让我变圆。

06:00.528 --> 06:01.395
ALL RIGHT.
好的。

06:01.429 --> 06:02.963
LET'S GET TO IT.
让我们开始吧。

06:02.996 --> 06:05.098
( shaver buzzing )
（剃须刀嗡嗡声）

06:10.804 --> 06:11.939
WHAT DO YOU THINK?
你怎么认为？

06:11.972 --> 06:13.373
PERFECT.
完美的。

06:14.608 --> 06:15.976
NOW, THAT'S SCARY!
现在，这太可怕了！

06:17.678 --> 06:21.415
LET'S GO SCARE SOMEBODY.
我们去吓唬一下吧。

06:21.449 --> 06:22.650
SpongeBob:
WHOO...
海绵宝宝：
呼...

06:22.683 --> 06:25.986
I'M THE FLYING DUTCHMAN!
我是飞翔的荷兰人！

06:26.019 --> 06:27.120
OOH...
噢...

06:27.154 --> 06:30.057
I DON'T KNOW WHO I AM!
我不知道我是谁！

06:30.090 --> 06:31.725
( doorbell rings )
（门铃响了）

06:31.759 --> 06:33.494
RAR, RAR!
RAR，RAR！
RAR，RAR！
解压，解压！

06:33.527 --> 06:36.597
I'M THE FLYING
DUTCHMAN.
我是飞翔者
荷兰人。

06:36.630 --> 06:37.865
Patrick:
OOH...
帕特里克：
噢...

06:37.898 --> 06:41.735
I'M THE FLYING
DUTCHMAN'S BEST FRIEND.
我是飞翔者
荷兰人最好的朋友。

06:41.769 --> 06:42.936
( both laughing )
（两人都笑了）

06:42.970 --> 06:45.606
HEY, DON'T YOU KIDS
WANT YOUR CANDY?
嘿，孩子们，别这样吗？
想要你的糖果吗？

06:45.639 --> 06:49.877
( both laughing )
（两人都笑了）

06:49.910 --> 06:51.512
OH, BOY,
THAT WAS SOMETHING.
哦，男孩，
那是很重要的事情。

06:51.545 --> 06:53.981
YOUR COSTUME
REALLY PACKS A PUNCH.
你的服装
确实很有冲击力。

06:54.014 --> 06:54.848
DO YOU THINK?
你觉得吗？

06:54.882 --> 06:56.617
OH, NO QUESTION.
哦，没问题。

06:56.650 --> 06:59.186
YOU SCARED THE BARNACLES
OFF THAT GUY.
你吓坏了藤壶
滚开那个家伙。

06:59.219 --> 07:00.821
WHO SHOULD WE SCARE NEXT?
接下来我们应该吓唬谁？

07:00.854 --> 07:03.724
THERE'S A WHOLE PARTY
JUST FULL OF PEOPLE
有一个完整的派对
挤满了人

07:03.757 --> 07:05.225
DOWN AT THE KRUSTY KRAB
来到蟹堡王

07:05.258 --> 07:09.963
AND THE FLYING DUTCHMAN IS
GOING TO SHOW UP UNINVITED.
飞翔的荷兰人是
不请自来的出现。

07:09.997 --> 07:11.499
( people laughing outside )
（外面的人在笑）

07:11.532 --> 07:13.066
OOH, HERE COMES
SOMEONE NOW.
哦，来了
现在有人了。

07:14.968 --> 07:16.136
RAR!
RAR！
RAR！
解压！

07:16.169 --> 07:17.771
WHOO...
呼...

07:17.805 --> 07:20.674
( in quavery voice ):
I'M THE FLYING DUTCHMAN!
（颤抖的声音）：
我是飞翔的荷兰人！

07:20.708 --> 07:22.576
( laughing )
（笑）

07:22.610 --> 07:23.711
( laughing )
（笑）

07:23.744 --> 07:26.547
WASN'T THAT
THE HAUNTED
MATTRESS?
不是那样吗
闹鬼的
床垫？

07:26.580 --> 07:30.884
I GUESS HE'S BEEN DEMOTED
TO A HAUNTED SLEEPING BAG.
我猜他被降职了
到一个闹鬼的睡袋。

07:30.918 --> 07:31.985
( laughing )
（笑）

07:32.019 --> 07:34.855
( party music playing )
（派对音乐播放）

07:34.888 --> 07:37.057
( general conversation )
（一般对话）

07:42.730 --> 07:44.598
( choking and coughing )
（窒息和咳嗽）

07:44.632 --> 07:48.636
OH, DAD, YOU'RE
EMBARRASSING ME AGAIN.
哦，爸爸，你是
又让我难堪了。

07:48.669 --> 07:49.837
( crying )
（哭）

07:49.870 --> 07:50.771
( gagging, gasping )
（作呕，喘气）

07:52.005 --> 07:53.173
( spurt )
（冲刺）

07:53.206 --> 07:54.174
( whistle )
（哨声）

07:54.207 --> 07:55.609
( glass shatters )
（玻璃碎裂）

07:55.643 --> 07:58.145
HOWDY, SQUIDWARD...
I MEAN FLYING DUTCHMAN.
你好，章鱼哥……
我指的是飞翔的荷兰人。

07:58.178 --> 07:59.713
GREAT PARTY, HUH?
很棒的派对，嗯？

07:59.747 --> 08:01.248
WHAT ARE YOU
SUPPOSED TO BE?
你是什么？
应该是吗？

08:01.281 --> 08:04.084
WHY, I'M A PET GOLDFISH
IN A BOWL.
为什么，我是宠物金鱼
在一个碗里。

08:05.819 --> 08:06.654
I DON'T GET IT.
我不明白。

08:07.788 --> 08:09.189
( slurping )
（吸食）

08:14.562 --> 08:16.229
ARE YOU READY,
SPONGEBOB?
你准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝？

08:19.700 --> 08:20.868
OKAY, PATRICK.
好吧，帕特里克。

08:20.901 --> 08:21.902
KILL THE LIGHTS.
关掉灯。

08:22.970 --> 08:23.937
( music stops )
（音乐停止）

08:23.971 --> 08:25.205
( people screaming )
（人们尖叫）

08:25.238 --> 08:28.676
( Patrick laughing evilly )
（帕特里克邪恶地笑）

08:28.709 --> 08:32.546
I AM THE FLYING DUTCHMAN!
我是飞翔的荷兰人！

08:32.580 --> 08:34.147
BOOGA, BOOGA, BOOGA, BOOGA!
布加，布加，布加，布加！

08:34.181 --> 08:35.616
( rattling )
（嘎嘎作响）

08:35.649 --> 08:38.586
( eerily ):
GIVE ME YOUR SOULS!
（诡异地）：
把你的灵魂给我！

08:40.153 --> 08:42.623
( buzzing )
（嗡嗡声）

08:42.656 --> 08:43.123
( zap )
（扎普）

08:44.625 --> 08:45.626
HUH?
嗯？

08:48.061 --> 08:49.096
( Patrick yelling )
（帕特里克大喊）

08:49.129 --> 08:51.632
( SpongeBob screaming )
（海绵宝宝尖叫）

08:51.665 --> 08:52.733
( yelling )
（大喊）

08:52.766 --> 08:53.867
WHOA!
哇啊！

08:53.901 --> 08:55.068
( yelling )
（大喊）

08:55.102 --> 08:58.872
( yelling and screaming )
（大喊大叫）

08:58.906 --> 09:01.174
OOH! AAH!
哦！啊啊！

09:01.208 --> 09:02.676
OUCH!
哎哟！

09:02.710 --> 09:04.645
( SpongeBob yells )
（海绵宝宝大喊）

09:04.678 --> 09:09.049
( yelling repeatedly )
（反复喊叫）

09:09.082 --> 09:11.251
( yelling slows to halt )
（喊叫声逐渐停止）

09:11.284 --> 09:13.220
HEY, THAT'S NO DUTCHMAN.
嘿，那不是荷兰人。

09:13.253 --> 09:14.688
THAT'S SPONGEBOB!
那是海绵宝宝！

09:14.722 --> 09:15.923
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

09:15.956 --> 09:17.224
SPONGEBOB.
海绵宝宝。

09:17.257 --> 09:20.861
( all laughing )
（大家都笑了）

09:20.894 --> 09:22.730
HELP!
帮助！

09:22.763 --> 09:23.931
HELP!
帮助！

09:23.964 --> 09:26.900
I AM NOT SPONGEBOB!
我不是海绵宝宝！

09:26.934 --> 09:29.302
THOSE ARE MY STREET CLOTHES.
这些是我的街头服装。

09:29.336 --> 09:31.905
( partygoers laughing )
（聚会常客大笑）

09:31.939 --> 09:33.841
FLYING DUTCHMAN?!
飞翔的荷兰人？！

09:33.874 --> 09:35.275
FLYING DOPEMAN!
飞行毒液人！

09:35.308 --> 09:36.610
( thunder )
（雷声）

09:36.644 --> 09:38.879
Deep male voice:
ENOUGH!
低沉的男声：
够了！

09:38.912 --> 09:39.813
( all gasp )
（全都喘气）

09:43.917 --> 09:45.886
( laughing evilly )
（邪恶地笑）

09:47.855 --> 09:50.858
IT'S THE REAL FLYING DUTCHMAN!
这是真正的飞翔荷兰人！

09:50.891 --> 09:51.992
( gasps )
（喘气）

09:53.861 --> 09:58.198
YOU BET YOUR LILY WHITE LIVERS
I'M THE FLYING DUTCHMAN.
你拿你的百合白肝做赌注
我是飞翔的荷兰人。

09:58.231 --> 10:00.267
AND I'LL LET YOU IN
ON A LITTLE SECRET.
我会让你进来
关于一个小秘密。

10:00.300 --> 10:03.637
I'M GOING TO STEAL YOUR SOUL!
我要偷走你的灵魂！

10:03.671 --> 10:06.039
( screaming )
（尖叫）

10:07.140 --> 10:09.276
QUIET!
安静的！

10:09.309 --> 10:13.013
YOU HAD IT COMING,
YOU BIG CRYBABIES.
你已经来了，
你们这些大爱哭鬼。

10:13.046 --> 10:17.651
EVERY YEAR,
PEOPLE DRESSING LIKE ME!
每年，
人们穿着像我一样！

10:17.685 --> 10:18.752
( whistling nonchalantly )
（漫不经心地吹着口哨）

10:18.786 --> 10:22.990
TURNING THE FLYING DUTCHMAN NAME
INTO A LAUGHINGSTOCK!
改变飞翔荷兰人的名字
沦为笑柄！

10:23.023 --> 10:26.059
BUT THAT'S NOT THE REASON
I'M TAKING YOUR SOULS.
但这不是原因
我要夺走你的灵魂。

10:26.093 --> 10:30.864
NO, TH IS THE STRAW
THAT BROKE THE CAMEL'S BACK.
不，这是吸管
这压垮了骆驼的背。

10:30.898 --> 10:35.669
OUT OF ALL THE DUTCHMAN
COSTUMES I'VE SEEN
荷兰人中的佼佼者
我见过的服装

10:35.703 --> 10:39.807
YOURS IS THE MOST INSULTING.
你的是最侮辱性的。

10:39.840 --> 10:42.109
DO YOU MEAN
I'M NOT SCARY?
你的意思是
我不可怕吗？

10:42.142 --> 10:43.677
YOU?!
你？！

10:43.711 --> 10:44.945
SCARY?
可怕的？

10:44.978 --> 10:49.950
( laughing thunderously )
（笑得雷鸣般）

10:49.983 --> 10:52.953
LET ME TELL YOU
ABOUT SCARY, KID.
让我告诉你
关于可怕的孩子。

10:52.986 --> 10:56.690
THERE'S ALL KINDS OF
SCARY THINGS IN THE WORLD.
各种都有
世界上可怕的事情。

10:56.724 --> 10:59.192
SPIDERS ARE SCARY.
蜘蛛很可怕。

10:59.226 --> 11:01.028
I'M SCARY.
我很害怕。

11:01.061 --> 11:02.129
YOU?
你？

11:02.162 --> 11:04.965
YOU'RE NOT SCARY.
你并不可怕。

11:04.998 --> 11:07.167
OKAY, LET'S
GET THIS OVER WITH.
好吧，让我们
把这件事结束吧。

11:08.736 --> 11:10.203
( laughing evilly )
（邪恶地笑）

11:10.237 --> 11:13.340
( screaming )
（尖叫）

11:13.373 --> 11:15.142
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

11:15.175 --> 11:17.811
FIRST I GOT TO GET RID
OF THIS STUPID COSTUME.
首先我必须摆脱
这件愚蠢的服装。

11:20.147 --> 11:23.984
( yelling )
（大喊）

11:26.286 --> 11:28.155
HEY, WHAT DO YOU KNOW!
嘿，你知道什么！

11:28.188 --> 11:29.356
I SCARED HIM!
我吓到他了！

11:29.389 --> 11:31.158
( laughing )
（笑）

11:31.191 --> 11:32.960
( all screaming )
（大家尖叫）

11:35.028 --> 11:36.196
IT WORKED, PATRICK.
它起作用了，帕特里克。

11:36.229 --> 11:37.998
I SCARED EVERYBODY.
我吓坏了所有人。

11:38.031 --> 11:38.999
YEAH.
是的。

11:39.032 --> 11:41.268
I GUESS IT WAS
YOUR PINK HAT.
我猜是
你的粉红帽子。

11:41.301 --> 11:43.103
PINK HAT? OH, THAT'S NOT A HAT.
粉红帽子？哦，那不是帽子。

11:43.136 --> 11:44.972
THAT'S MY BRAIN.
那是我的大脑。

11:45.005 --> 11:46.940
OH...
哦...

11:46.974 --> 11:50.110
( screaming )
（尖叫）

11:50.143 --> 11:52.012
SpongeBob:
DON'T WORRY. IT GROWS BACK.
海绵宝宝：
别担心。它又长回来了。

12:06.827 --> 12:10.130
EXERCISE TIME
IS OVER, GARY.
锻炼时间
结束了，加里。

12:10.163 --> 12:11.932
WE DON'T WANT YOU
GETTING TOO THIN.
我们不想要你
变得太瘦了。

12:11.965 --> 12:13.100
HERE, BOY.
在这里，男孩。

12:13.133 --> 12:14.734
FETCH!
拿来！

12:25.478 --> 12:26.880
( rooster crows )
（公鸡打鸣）

12:26.914 --> 12:27.981
( snoring )
（打鼾）

12:34.054 --> 12:35.088
( meows )
（喵）

12:36.289 --> 12:37.557
HUH?
嗯？

12:37.590 --> 12:39.259
GOOD JOB, GARY.
干得好，加里。

12:39.292 --> 12:41.895
I LOVE YOU, GARY.
我爱你，加里。

12:41.929 --> 12:43.496
GARY, GARY,
GARY, GARY...
加里，加里，
加里，加里……

12:43.530 --> 12:44.497
( purring )
（咕噜声）

12:44.531 --> 12:45.799
GARY, GARY, GARY.
加里，加里，加里。

12:45.833 --> 12:46.867
( laughing )
（笑）

12:46.900 --> 12:47.935
DOWN, BOY!
下来，男孩！

12:47.968 --> 12:48.936
( laughing )
（笑）

12:48.969 --> 12:50.537
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

12:50.570 --> 12:51.839
ARE YOU READY?
你准备好了吗？

12:51.872 --> 12:52.973
ARE YOU READY?
你准备好了吗？

12:53.006 --> 12:54.241
ARE YOU READY?
你准备好了吗？

12:54.274 --> 12:56.009
FOR WHAT?
为了什么？

12:56.043 --> 13:00.914
THE ANNUAL JELLYFISH CONVENTION
IN UKULELE BOTTOM THIS WEEKEND.
一年一度的水母大会
这个周末在尤克里里底部。

13:00.948 --> 13:02.515
HA... YA!
哈……是啊！

13:02.549 --> 13:04.784
( yelling )
（大喊）

13:07.154 --> 13:08.188
( glass shatters )
（玻璃碎裂）

13:09.456 --> 13:10.891
SO, YOU READY OR WHAT?
那么，你准备好了吗？

13:10.924 --> 13:12.926
THAT WAS THIS WEEKEND?
那是这个周末吗？

13:12.960 --> 13:14.261
I CAN'T GO.
我不能去。

13:14.294 --> 13:16.897
I DON'T HAVE ANYONE
TO TAKE CARE OF GARY.
我没有人
照顾加里。

13:23.403 --> 13:27.274
WOULD YOU PLEASE STOP
LEAVING YOUR UNDERGARMENTS
请你停下来好吗
留下你的内衣

13:27.307 --> 13:29.242
ON MY FRONT LAWN?
在我家门前的草坪上？

13:29.276 --> 13:32.112
SQUIDWARD, COULD YOU
WATCH GARY THIS WEEKEND?
章鱼哥，你可以吗
这个周末看加里吗？

13:32.145 --> 13:33.513
WHAT'S A GARY?
加里是什么？

13:33.546 --> 13:35.215
NOT A GARY-- GARY.
不是加里——加里。

13:35.248 --> 13:36.216
HE'S MY PET SNAIL.
他是我的宠物蜗牛。

13:36.249 --> 13:37.450
( pop )
（ 流行音乐 ）

13:37.484 --> 13:39.186
SAY "HELLO."
问好。”

13:39.219 --> 13:40.921
( hisses )
（嘶嘶声）

13:40.954 --> 13:42.055
AAH!
啊啊！

13:42.089 --> 13:44.257
YOU ACTUALLY CARE
FOR THAT THING?
您真正关心
为了那件事？

13:44.291 --> 13:46.293
I LOVE GARY!
我爱加里！

13:46.326 --> 13:47.394
WELL, I DON'T.
嗯，我不。

13:47.427 --> 13:49.096
GET SOMEBODY ELSE.
找其他人吧。

13:49.129 --> 13:51.031
I GUESS WE CAN'T GO
AWAY THIS WEEKEND
我想我们不能去
这个周末离开

13:51.064 --> 13:52.532
AFTER ALL, PATRICK.
毕竟，帕特里克。

13:52.565 --> 13:54.101
GO AWAY?
离开？

13:54.134 --> 13:56.436
YOU MEAN,
IF I WATCH GARY
你的意思是，
如果我看加里

13:56.469 --> 13:59.873
YOU GUYS WILL BE
GONE ALL WEEKEND?
你们将会是
整个周末都走了？

13:59.907 --> 14:02.009
ACTUALLY,
A THREE-DAY WEEKEND.
事实上，
三天的周末。

14:02.042 --> 14:05.012
AS IN "NOT HERE
FOR THREE DAYS"?
正如“不在这里”
三天”？

14:05.045 --> 14:07.414
YEAH, BUT YOU'VE ALREADY
SAID YOU CAN'T DO IT.
是的，但你已经
说你做不到。

14:07.447 --> 14:08.415
WE UNDERSTAND.
我们明白。

14:08.448 --> 14:10.017
DON'T FEEL BAD,
SQUIDWARD.
别难过，
章鱼哥。

14:10.050 --> 14:12.119
THE THREE OF US
CAN STILL HAVE
我们三个人
还可以有

14:12.152 --> 14:14.087
OUR OWN JELLYFISH
CONVENTION
我们自己的水母
公约

14:14.121 --> 14:14.922
AT YOUR HOUSE.
在你家里。

14:14.955 --> 14:16.489
I CHANGED
MY MIND.
我改变了
我的想法。

14:16.523 --> 14:19.226
YOU GUYS DESERVE
A WEEKEND AWAY.
你们值得拥有
一个周末。

14:19.259 --> 14:20.227
YOU'LL DO IT?
你会做吗？

14:20.260 --> 14:21.228
GREAT!
伟大的！

14:21.261 --> 14:23.163
LET ME SHOW YOU
A LITTLE BIT
让我告诉你
一点点

14:23.196 --> 14:25.065
ABOUT SNAIL CARE.
关于蜗牛护理。

14:25.098 --> 14:27.968
YOU NEED TO TAKE
GARY FOR A WALK
TWICE A DAY...
你需要采取
加里散步
一天两次...

14:28.001 --> 14:33.040
Squidward:
FRIDAY, SATURDAY AND SUNDAY--
A THREE-DAY WEEKEND.
章鱼哥：
周五、周六和周日——
三天的周末。

14:33.073 --> 14:35.142
LET ME SHOW YOU
HOW TO FEED HIM.
让我告诉你
如何喂养他。

14:35.175 --> 14:37.344
A CAN IN THE MORNING
AND A CAN AT NIGHT.
早上一罐
晚上还有一罐。

14:37.377 --> 14:39.679
( sarcastically ):
SURE IT'S ENOUGH?
（讽刺地）：
确定足够了吗？

14:39.712 --> 14:44.184
Group:
JELLYFISHING, JELLYFISHING,
JELLYFISHING, JELLYFISHING!
组：
捕水母，捕水母，
捕水母，捕水母！

14:44.217 --> 14:46.086
THE BUS IS HERE!
巴士来了！

14:46.119 --> 14:48.455
THE BUS IS HERE!
巴士来了！

14:48.488 --> 14:50.090
COME ON, SPONGEBOB!
来吧，海绵宝宝！

14:50.123 --> 14:52.459
All:
JELLYFISHING! JELLYFISHING!
全部：
捕水母！捕水母！

14:52.492 --> 14:55.128
TIME TO GO.
DON'T WANT TO BE LATE. BYE-BYE.
是时候出发了。
不想迟到。再见。

14:55.162 --> 14:57.330
YOU WON'T FORGET
MY INSTRUCTIONS, WILL YOU?
你不会忘记
我的指示，你愿意吗？

14:57.364 --> 14:59.432
I HAVE THE MEMORY
OF AN ELEPHANT.
我有记忆
大象的肖像。

14:59.466 --> 15:00.934
I'LL TAKE GOOD CARE OF FRED.
我会照顾好弗雷德的。

15:00.968 --> 15:01.701
GARY.
加里。

15:01.734 --> 15:03.070
RIGHT, YEAH, RIGHT.
对，对，对。

15:03.103 --> 15:04.938
Group:
JELLYFISHING!
组：
捕水母！

15:04.972 --> 15:06.173
All:
JELLYFISHING! JELLYFISHING!
全部：
捕水母！捕水母！

15:06.206 --> 15:07.975
SO LONG, LOSERS!
再见，失败者！

15:08.008 --> 15:09.009
( laughs )
（笑）

15:09.042 --> 15:10.543
THEY'RE GONE.
他们走了。

15:10.577 --> 15:11.945
( laughs )
（笑）

15:13.713 --> 15:15.949
( meows )
（喵）

15:18.185 --> 15:20.153
( humming )
（嗡嗡声）

15:20.187 --> 15:24.291
THIS IS GOING TO BE
THE BEST THREE DAYS OF MY LIFE.
这将会是
我生命中最美好的三天。

15:24.324 --> 15:27.260
( sighs )
（叹气）

15:27.294 --> 15:29.596
I'M GOING TO DO ALL THE THINGS
我会做所有的事情

15:29.629 --> 15:33.066
I CAN'T NORMALLY DO
BECAUSE OF SPONGEBOB.
我通常做不到
因为海绵宝宝。

15:36.436 --> 15:38.438
( sizzling quietly )
（静静地嘶嘶作响）

15:38.471 --> 15:42.442
Group:
JELLYFISHING! JELLYFISHING!
JELLYFISHING! JELLYFISHING!
组：
捕水母！捕水母！
捕水母！捕水母！

15:42.475 --> 15:47.680
WELL, THUS ENDS THE GREATEST
WEEKEND OF MY LIFE.
好了，最伟大的就这样结束了
我生命中的周末。

15:47.714 --> 15:53.086
NO SPONGEBOB, NO PATRICK,
NOTHING BUT ME, ME, ME.
没有海绵宝宝，没有帕特里克，
除了我，我，我什么都没有。

15:55.422 --> 15:57.524
( groans gutturally )
（喉间呻吟）

15:57.557 --> 15:58.625
( thud )
（砰）

16:00.260 --> 16:01.461
( screams )
（尖叫声）

16:01.494 --> 16:03.463
THE SNAIL! I FORGOT THE SNAIL!
蜗牛！我忘了蜗牛！

16:04.497 --> 16:06.366
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

16:06.399 --> 16:08.035
( moans )
（呻吟声）

16:10.103 --> 16:11.438
I'VE GOT TO DO SOMETHING.
我必须做点什么。

16:13.106 --> 16:14.474
OH!
哦！

16:18.411 --> 16:19.412
OKAY, OKAY, OKAY.
好吧，好吧，好吧。

16:19.446 --> 16:21.014
HERE WE GO, RIGHT HERE.
我们来了，就在这里。

16:21.048 --> 16:22.582
EAT, EAT, EAT, EAT, EAT, EAT!
吃，吃，吃，吃，吃，吃！

16:22.615 --> 16:24.551
YOU'VE GOT TO FINISH THIS FOOD!
你必须吃完这顿饭！

16:25.652 --> 16:27.187
SEE YOU LATER, PATRICK.
稍后见，帕特里克。

16:29.256 --> 16:32.192
COME ON, EAT! EAT! EAT!
来吧，吃吧！吃！吃！

16:33.593 --> 16:35.362
AAH... AAH... AAH...
啊……啊……啊……

16:35.395 --> 16:36.629
OH!
哦！

16:39.166 --> 16:42.635
GARY, I'M HOME!
加里，我回来了！

16:42.669 --> 16:44.137
HI, SPONGEBOB.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

16:44.171 --> 16:45.705
SQUIDWARD, WHY ARE YOU HERE?
章鱼哥，你为什么在这里？

16:45.738 --> 16:47.374
( gulps hard )
（艰难地咽了口口水）

16:47.407 --> 16:48.708
AAH!
啊啊！

16:48.741 --> 16:51.644
JUST, UH, CHECKING UP
ON OLD GARY FOR YOU.
只是，呃，检查一下
为你讲述老加里。

16:51.678 --> 16:53.680
YOU'RE A GREAT FRIEND,
SQUIDWARD.
你是一个好朋友，
章鱼哥。

16:53.713 --> 16:55.482
WELL, I GUESS
I'LL SEE YOU LATER.
嗯，我猜
稍后见。

16:55.515 --> 16:56.483
BYE.
再见。

16:56.516 --> 16:57.517
THANKS, SQUIDWARD.
谢谢，章鱼哥。

16:57.550 --> 16:59.219
I CAN ALWAYS COUNT ON YOU.
我永远可以信赖你。

16:59.252 --> 17:02.222
( wheezes )
（喘息声）

17:02.255 --> 17:03.256
( screams )
（尖叫声）

17:03.290 --> 17:04.657
GARY!
加里！

17:04.691 --> 17:07.327
GARY, WHAT'S HAPPENED TO YOU?
加里，你怎么了？

17:07.360 --> 17:08.195
WHAT'S WRONG?
怎么了？

17:08.228 --> 17:10.697
SQUIDWARD, SOMETHING'S
WRONG WITH GARY!
章鱼哥，有事
加里错了！

17:10.730 --> 17:13.133
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

17:13.166 --> 17:15.235
OH!
哦！

17:15.268 --> 17:18.705
Male fish:
YES, YES, IT'S
JUST AS I THOUGHT.
雄鱼：
是的，是的，是的
正如我所想。

17:18.738 --> 17:20.073
WHAT?
什么？

17:20.107 --> 17:22.542
THIS IS DEFINITELY
A SNAIL.
这绝对是
一只蜗牛。

17:22.575 --> 17:23.576
( gasps )
（喘气）

17:23.610 --> 17:24.844
I KNEW IT!
我就知道！

17:24.877 --> 17:28.348
OH, SQUID,
DID YOU HEAR THAT?
哦，鱿鱼，
你听到了吗？

17:28.381 --> 17:30.517
THEREFORE, A SHOT
OF SNAIL PLASMA
因此，一击
蜗牛血浆

17:30.550 --> 17:32.419
MUST BE CAREFULLY ADMINISTERED.
必须谨慎管理。

17:32.452 --> 17:34.187
HERE YOU GO.
干得好。

17:34.221 --> 17:35.488
YOU WON'T DO IT?
你不会这么做吗？

17:35.522 --> 17:38.091
OH, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO, NO.
哦，不，不，不，不，不，不，不。

17:38.125 --> 17:40.293
I'M TOO SQUEAMISH.
我太娇气了。

17:41.894 --> 17:43.163
UH, HANG ON, DOC.
呃，坚持住，博士。

17:43.196 --> 17:45.098
LET ME HELP YOU
WITH YOUR BAG THERE.
让我帮助你
带着你的包。

17:45.132 --> 17:46.233
SQUID, WAIT.
鱿鱼，等等。

17:46.266 --> 17:47.600
I CAN'T GIVE GARY HIS PLASMA.
我不能给加里他的血浆。

17:47.634 --> 17:49.436
I'M SQUEAMISH, TOO.
我也很拘谨。

17:49.469 --> 17:52.172
OH, SPONGEBOB,
I DON'T WANT TO...
哦，海绵宝宝，
我不想...

17:52.205 --> 17:55.642
( violent coughing )
（剧烈咳嗽）

17:55.675 --> 17:57.244
GARY!
加里！

17:57.277 --> 17:59.312
OKAY, OKAY, I'LL DO IT.
好吧，好吧，我会做的。

17:59.346 --> 18:01.281
NOW, DON'T HURT HIM, SQUIDWARD.
现在，不要伤害他，章鱼哥。

18:01.314 --> 18:02.882
OKAY, STEADY.
好的，稳定。

18:02.915 --> 18:04.351
WAIT, THAT'S TOO HARD.
等等，这太难了。

18:04.384 --> 18:06.553
OKAY, OKAY, OKAY,
OKAY, TRY IT AGAIN.
好吧，好吧，好吧，
好的，再试一次。

18:07.687 --> 18:09.389
WAIT!
等待！

18:09.422 --> 18:11.158
WAIT. WAIT. WAIT.
等待。等待。等待。

18:11.191 --> 18:12.459
( stammers ):
HOLD HIM STILL.
（结巴）：
按住他不动。

18:12.492 --> 18:13.593
WAIT. WAIT. WAIT.
等待。等待。等待。

18:13.626 --> 18:15.128
HOLD HIM STILL!
WAIT.
按住他！
等待。

18:15.162 --> 18:16.129
OUCH!
哎哟！

18:16.163 --> 18:17.364
UH, SQUIDWARD...
呃，章鱼哥……

18:17.397 --> 18:19.666
YOU'VE INJECTED ME
WITH SNAIL PLASMA.
你给我注射了
与蜗牛血浆。

18:19.699 --> 18:21.401
WELL, YOU MADE
ME DO IT.
好吧，你做了
我来做。

18:21.434 --> 18:23.303
WHAT'S GOING
TO HAPPEN TO ME?
发生了什么
会发生在我身上吗？

18:23.336 --> 18:26.573
OH, NOTHING, IT'S JUST
A LITTLE SNAIL PLASMA.
哦，没什么，只是
一点蜗牛血浆。

18:26.606 --> 18:28.908
I DON'T KNOW,
I FEEL KIND OF FUNNY.
我不知道，
我觉得有点好笑。

18:28.941 --> 18:31.344
Squidward:
IT'S ALL IN YOUR HEAD!
章鱼哥：
一切都在你的脑海里！

18:31.378 --> 18:33.446
( moans )
（呻吟声）

18:33.480 --> 18:34.914
( gulps )
（咽了口口水）

18:34.947 --> 18:37.884
( gargles, then clears throat )
（漱口，然后清喉咙）

18:37.917 --> 18:39.152
( meows spiritedly )
（兴奋地喵喵叫）

18:39.186 --> 18:42.155
HE JUST NEEDED WATER?
他只需要水？

18:42.189 --> 18:44.791
OH, GARY,
YOU'RE BETTER!
哦，加里，
你更好了！

18:46.426 --> 18:47.494
OH, HOW TOUCHING.
哦，多么感人啊。

18:47.527 --> 18:50.263
I'M GOING TO GO HOME
AND THROW UP.
我要回家了
并呕吐。

18:50.297 --> 18:51.298
GOOD NIGHT.
晚安。

18:51.331 --> 18:52.299
SQUIDWARD, WAIT!
章鱼哥，等等！

18:52.332 --> 18:53.333
THE SNAIL PLASMA.
蜗牛等离子体。

18:53.366 --> 18:54.734
TRUST ME, SPONGEBOB.
相信我，海绵宝宝。

18:54.767 --> 18:57.337
NOTHING'S GOING
TO HAPPEN TO YOU.
什么都没有发生
发生在你身上的事。

18:57.370 --> 18:58.738
YOU'RE FINE.
你很好。

18:58.771 --> 19:00.340
( meows )
（喵）

19:00.373 --> 19:01.474
DON'T WORRY, GARY.
别担心，加里。

19:01.508 --> 19:03.510
SQUIDWARD SAYS
I'LL BE FINE.
章鱼哥说
我会没事的。

19:03.543 --> 19:05.312
HE KNOWS EVERYTHING.
他什么都知道。

19:05.345 --> 19:06.446
SO, YOU HUNGRY?
那么，你饿了吗？

19:06.479 --> 19:07.814
( meows loudly )
（大声喵叫）

19:16.289 --> 19:17.424
HMM?
唔？

19:17.457 --> 19:20.193
HMM!
唔！

19:20.227 --> 19:22.429
MMM.
嗯。

19:22.462 --> 19:24.297
MMM, MMM, MMM.
嗯，嗯，嗯。

19:25.298 --> 19:26.266
HERE YOU GO.
干得好。

19:26.299 --> 19:27.467
EAT UP, GARY.
吃吧，加里。

19:27.500 --> 19:28.768
( meows questioningly )
（疑惑地喵喵叫）

19:31.938 --> 19:34.274
SORRY, GARY,
I COULDN'T CONTROL MYSELF.
抱歉，加里，
我无法控制自己。

19:34.307 --> 19:35.275
( burps )
（打嗝）

19:35.308 --> 19:36.276
MEOW.
喵。

19:36.309 --> 19:37.544
WHY'D I JUST DO THAT?
我为什么要这么做？

19:37.577 --> 19:38.711
AM I CRACKING UP?
我崩溃了吗？

19:38.745 --> 19:40.480
( meows )
（喵）

19:40.513 --> 19:42.315
NO. NO, SQUIDWARD'S RIGHT.
不。不，章鱼哥是对的。

19:42.349 --> 19:43.550
I'M FINE.
我很好。

19:43.583 --> 19:44.751
I WORRY TOO MUCH.
我担心太多了。

19:44.784 --> 19:46.419
IT'S ALL IN MY HEAD.
这一切都在我的脑海里。

19:46.453 --> 19:48.521
I FEEL TIP-TOP.
我感觉非常好。

19:51.491 --> 19:52.359
GARY, YOU'RE GETTING
加里，你得到了

19:52.392 --> 19:54.227
( voice slows ):
A LOT FASTER.
（声音放慢）：
快得多。

19:54.261 --> 19:58.231
( footsteps thumping loudly )
（脚步声重重）

19:58.265 --> 20:00.467
( voice echoes ):
LOOK AT ME.
（声音回声）：
看着我。

20:00.500 --> 20:01.634
NEVER BETTER.
从来没有更好过。

20:01.668 --> 20:02.702
( yelps )
（尖叫声）

20:02.735 --> 20:04.504
I'M OKAY.
我没事。

20:04.537 --> 20:06.339
SQUIDWARD SAID I'M FINE.
章鱼哥说我很好。

20:06.373 --> 20:07.707
( screams )
（尖叫声）

20:08.908 --> 20:10.643
( shrieks )
（尖叫声）

20:10.677 --> 20:12.912
GARY! I'M FINE!
加里！我很好！

20:13.980 --> 20:16.349
( straining ):
YOU SEE?
（拉紧）：
你看到了吗？

20:16.383 --> 20:18.985
( grunting )
（咕哝）

20:19.018 --> 20:22.289
THAT'S OKAY,
I'M A LEFTY, ANYWAY.
没关系，
无论如何，我是左撇子。

20:22.322 --> 20:23.390
( grunts, screams )
（咕哝声、尖叫声）

20:23.423 --> 20:26.326
NOW I DON'T HAVE TO BUY
THOSE NEW SHOES.
现在我不必购买
那些新鞋。

20:26.359 --> 20:30.330
( screams and groans )
（尖叫声和呻吟声）

20:30.363 --> 20:32.465
I TAKE IT BACK, GARY.
我收回这句话，加里。

20:32.499 --> 20:35.268
SOMETHING IS WRONG WITH ME!
我有点不对劲！

20:35.302 --> 20:36.403
OW.
哦。

20:36.436 --> 20:40.507
I HOPE I NEVER SEE
ANOTHER SNAIL AGAIN.
我希望我永远不会看到
又是一只蜗牛。

20:40.540 --> 20:41.608
GOOD NIGHT, CLARI.
晚安，克拉里。

20:41.641 --> 20:43.943
( doorbell rings,
knock on door )
（门铃响了，
敲门）

20:43.976 --> 20:45.378
WHO COULD THAT BE?
那会是谁？

20:45.412 --> 20:47.314
AS IF I DIDN'T ALREADY KNOW.
就好像我还不知道一样。

20:47.347 --> 20:50.850
SPONGEBOB, I ALREADY TOLD YOU:
海绵宝宝，我已经告诉过你了：

20:50.883 --> 20:53.986
YOU'RE GOING TO BE JUST FI...
你会很好...

20:54.020 --> 20:56.323
( screams )
（尖叫声）

20:56.356 --> 20:57.757
OW.
哦。

20:57.790 --> 20:59.392
( screams )
（尖叫声）

20:59.426 --> 21:01.394
MEOW, MEOW.
喵，喵。

21:07.567 --> 21:09.802
( screams )
（尖叫声）

21:09.836 --> 21:11.371
( panting )
（气喘吁吁）

21:11.404 --> 21:12.839
SPONGEBOB?
海绵宝宝？

21:12.872 --> 21:16.809
OH, NEPTUNE, WHAT HAVE I DONE?
哦，海王星，我做了什么？

21:16.843 --> 21:18.878
IT'S ALL YOUR FAULT.
都是你的错。

21:18.911 --> 21:20.747
OKAY, OKAY, OKAY, OKAY.
好吧，好吧，好吧，好吧。

21:20.780 --> 21:23.950
GET IT TOGETHER, SQUIDWARD.
团结起来，章鱼哥。

21:23.983 --> 21:25.552
MEOW!
喵！

21:25.585 --> 21:26.586
( screams )
（尖叫声）

21:29.356 --> 21:30.323
MEOW!
喵！

21:30.357 --> 21:31.558
MEOW, MEOW.
喵，喵。

21:31.591 --> 21:32.492
( screams )
（尖叫声）

21:32.525 --> 21:33.326
MEOW.
喵。

21:36.696 --> 21:37.597
( gasps )
（喘气）

21:39.432 --> 21:41.534
MEOW, MEOW.
喵，喵。

21:41.568 --> 21:43.670
( screams )
（尖叫声）

21:43.703 --> 21:46.739
NONE OF THIS WOULD BE HAPPENING
IF I'D ONLY FED THAT SNAIL.
这一切都不会发生
如果我只喂那只蜗牛就好了。

21:46.773 --> 21:48.508
MEOW.
喵。

21:48.541 --> 21:50.443
( screaming )
（尖叫）

21:50.477 --> 21:51.444
MEOW.
喵。

21:51.478 --> 21:54.113
( screaming )
（尖叫）

21:54.146 --> 21:55.515
MEOW.
喵。

21:55.548 --> 21:56.115
( screams )
（尖叫声）

21:56.148 --> 21:57.517
MEOW.
喵。

21:57.550 --> 21:58.117
( screams )
（尖叫声）

21:58.150 --> 21:59.852
MEOW.
喵。

21:59.886 --> 22:04.491
( screaming and
meowing continue )
（尖叫声和
继续喵喵叫）

22:11.698 --> 22:13.866
( glass shatters )
（玻璃碎裂）

22:17.704 --> 22:20.640
( groaning )
（呻吟）

22:20.673 --> 22:23.009
UH-OH.
呃-哦。

22:23.042 --> 22:26.646
Gary ( to "Blow the Man Down" ):
